  "notes": "<p>This show featured two bustouts: Peaches en Regalia, which was performed for the first time since July 22, 2017 (139 shows), and The Maker, which was performed for the first time since October 15, 1994 (1,001 shows). So Damn Lucky also made its Phish debut at this show. Tweezer contained Theme from <em>Quincy M.E. </em>and Freddie&#39;s Dead teases from Trey and The Lizards teases from Trey and Page. Trey teased Tweezer in Soul Planet and Tube. Trey teased Smoke on the Water in Meat. The encore featured Dave Matthews on guitar and vocals.</p>",
